        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour target is Albert Noah, an individual attempting to blackmail our client. The client requests that Mr. Noah be eliminated decisively to deter future blackmail attempts, hence the need for a louder approach than your usual methods.\r\rAdditionally, the contract has a secondary objective: retrieval of the compromising material from the target. He is unlikely to have it on his person prior to arranging the handover.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
